    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last survivor of a battalion (a teenage soldier) must protect the last letters of his fallen comrades until the end of the war on the islands. This story driven adventure, action and stealth game recreates historical events that took place during the Malvinas War. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect and assist others who are in danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready to avoid being shot from different angles during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the mouse to interact with certain objects through realistic movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the inventory to solve missions by finding specific items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Protect yourself from the unforgiving weather on the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a deep breath... War is tough.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last survivor of a battalion (a teenage soldier) must protect the last letters of his fallen comrades until the end of the war on the islands. This story driven adventure, action and stealth game recreates historical events that took place during the Malvinas War. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect and assist others who are in danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready to avoid being shot from different angles during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the mouse to interact with certain objects through realistic movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the inventory to solve missions by finding specific items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Protect yourself from the unforgiving weather on the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a deep breath... War is tough.</h2>",
    "short_description": "The last survivor of a battalion (a teenage soldier) must protect the last letter of his fallen comrades. Undergo the hunger, cold and violence the Argentinean soldiers had to endure during the war on the islands.",
